Source: src/lib/backend_linux.c, backend_mock.c, usb_backend.c.
JSONL writer and clock sampler in tools/hostlab are adapted from
src/lib/jsonl.c, clock.c and include/hostlab/{jsonl.h,hl_clock.h}.
The SDK does not include HostLab's experimental kernel patches.

The identification database records factual USB identifiers and links to
usbids, usbmuxd, libirecovery and Apple documentation. Their source code or
complete databases are not incorporated. The generated C table is project code.

Static ARMv6 release binaries link GNU libc and GCC runtime components supplied
by Debian's cross toolchain. Their copyright/license texts are included under
licenses/ in release archives, together with TOOLCHAIN_PACKAGES and BUILD_IMAGE.
Corresponding application source and relinkable objects are provided under
source/ and relink/. See docs/m7-release.md for source and relinking details.
